# BeeYardLog environment variables
#
# Copy this file to `.env` (or `.env.local`) if you ever need to override
# something. BeeYardLog currently needs NO environment variables: it runs
# fully offline and stores everything in the browser (IndexedDB).
#
# Vite only exposes variables that start with VITE_ to the browser code,
# and they are readable by anyone who opens the site, so never put
# secrets (API keys, passwords) in here.
#
# Example for later, if a feature needs it:
# VITE_APP_NAME=BeeYardLog
# Read in code with: import.meta.env.VITE_APP_NAME
